# --- the dogfood scratch root (scripts/dogfood-lap.md, scripts/dogfood-env.sh) ---
# A real lap materialises a continuo clone, two SQLite databases, a worktree, a
# rendered fence and captured session output, and docs/operations/lap-1-dogfood.md
# tells its reader to put all of it here. Ignored in the repository rather than in
# one machine's .git/info/exclude, because the reader following that procedure is
# on a fresh clone and would otherwise be one `git add -A` away from committing a
# control plane. `scripts/dogfood-env.sh` defaults its --root to a directory under
# here for the same reason.
/.worker-scratch/

# --- Node / TypeScript ---
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
.vitest-cache/
